WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.603
Whoa! Who are you?

2
00:00:09.604 --> 00:00:14.059
I am an African elephant.

3
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:19.790
We're the biggest land mammals on earth.

4
00:00:19.791 --> 00:00:23.897
You live in Africa, right?

5
00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:30.200
Yes! We live in grasslands and rain forests.

6
00:00:30.201 --> 00:00:35.496
Some African elephants live in deserts.

7
00:00:35.497 --> 00:00:38.772
How do you stay cool?

8
00:00:38.773 --> 00:00:43.054
We spray our backs with water.

9
00:00:43.055 --> 00:00:47.629
Then we throw dust on the water.

10
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:57.678
We use our trunks for that.

11
00:00:57.679 --> 00:01:01.741
Your trunk is amazing!

12
00:01:01.742 --> 00:01:08.511
Yes! We breathe and drink with our trunks.

13
00:01:08.512 --> 00:01:13.500
We can grab food with them too.

14
00:01:13.501 --> 00:01:16.470
What do you eat?

15
00:01:16.471 --> 00:01:23.188
We like leaves, bark, roots, fruit, and grass.

16
00:01:23.189 --> 00:01:27.869
We're big. So we eat a lot!

17
00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.824
Wow! Look at your tusks!

18
00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:35.890
Our tusks are long teeth.

19
00:01:35.891 --> 00:01:42.195
We use them to dig for roots.

20
00:01:42.196 --> 00:01:45.666
Do you have any enemies?

21
00:01:45.667 --> 00:01:49.854
Most animals leave us alone.

22
00:01:49.855 --> 00:01:56.745
But some people hunt us for our tusks.

23
00:01:56.746 --> 00:01:59.362
I'm hungry again.

24
00:01:59.363 --> 00:02:02.379
See you later.

25
00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:10.393
Good-bye, African Elephant!

